size 130 14
start
keys <C-w>2 j j
write todo.txt v1
tick 50ms
frame same-index
write todo.txt v2
tick 50ms
frame clamped
write todo.txt v3
tick 50ms
frame scrolls-instead
write todo.txt v4
tick 50ms
frame gone
write todo.txt v5
tick 50ms
frame emptied
